<http://data.silknow.org/object/7071ac2f-34e3-3d10-b7bd-3e7b3c551ea8>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Christening robe of white satin trimmed with matching silk braid and fringe. A long open coat pleated down the centre back and with a square neck and short straight semi-attached sleeves with a turn back cuff. Trimmed down the front with rows of braid and fringe, the undulations getting larger towards the hem and trimmed from the waist where the rondels meet with bows of matching satin ribbon. Lined with white silk."@en , "Christening robe of satin lined with silk, England, 18th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/b25adda4-52b6-3557-9f60-36da9e88401e> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Christening robe of white satin trimmed with matching silk braid and fringe. A long open coat pleated down the centre back and with a square neck and short straight semi-attached sleeves with a turn back cuff. Trimmed down the front with rows of braid and fringe, the undulations getting larger towards the hem and trimmed from the waist where the rondels meet with bows of matching satin ribbon. Lined with white silk."@en , "Christening robe of satin lined with silk, England, 18th century"@en ;
